      "title_zh": "币安上线Hyperliquid（HYPE），今日开放3个现货交易对 - 雅虎财经",
      "title_en": "Binance Lists Hyperliquid (HYPE) With 3 Spot Pairs Going Live Today - Yahoo Finance",
      "what_changed_zh": "币安上线Hyperliquid的HYPE代币，共三个现货交易对，同日开放交易，扩大了这一永续合约原生主流资产的现货准入。",
      "what_changed_en": "Binance listed Hyperliquid's HYPE token across three spot trading pairs, going live the same day, expanding spot access to a major perpetuals-native asset.",
      "current_state_zh": "币安上线Hyperliquid的HYPE代币，共三个现货交易对，同日开放交易，扩大了这一永续合约原生主流资产的现货准入。",
      "current_state_en": "Binance listed Hyperliquid's HYPE token across three spot trading pairs, going live the same day, expanding spot access to a major perpetuals-native asset.",
      "detailed_summary_zh": "Binance listed Hyperliquid's HYPE token across three spot trading pairs, going live the same day, expanding spot access to a major perpetuals-native asset.",
      "detailed_summary_en": "Binance listed Hyperliquid's HYPE token across three spot trading pairs, going live the same day, expanding spot access to a major perpetuals-native asset.",
      "background_zh": "Hyperliquid 自述其建设过程中没有私募投资者、没有付费做市商、也没有内部人，网络核心组件通过公开竞争产生。币安使用 Seed Tag、Monitoring Tag 等风险标签来标注其认为风险较高的代币，包括波动极端、流动性不足或存在下架风险的资产。",
      "background_en": "Hyperliquid describes itself as built with no private investors, no paid market makers and no insiders, with core network components developed through open competition. Binance uses risk labels such as the Seed Tag and the Monitoring Tag to flag tokens it considers higher-risk, including those with extreme volatility, low liquidity or delisting risk.",
      "community_discussion_zh": "",
      "community_discussion_en": "",
      "market_impact_zh": "Seed Tag 改变了 HYPE 在币安这一主要交易场所之一的风险分类，可能影响交易者对该资产的看法与交易准入条件。报道中提及的巨鲸向交易所转入代币，增加了订单簿卖方的 HYPE 可用数量，这一供给端渠道可能对短期流动性构成压力。",
      "market_impact_en": "The Seed Tag alters how HYPE is classified on Binance, one of the main venues where the token trades, which can affect trader perception and access conditions for the asset. The reported whale transfers onto exchanges raise the amount of HYPE available on the sell side of order books, a supply-side channel that can weigh on near-term liquidity.",
